{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/nant' data-target='computer\/programming\/nant' data-title='NAnt'>\r\n\t\t\tNAnt\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Notes: Zip, UnZip, Download, Installation, and To build release bits, run \"make ship\" or \"nant -D.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/programming\/nant\/notes.svg' alt='Notes: Zip, UnZip, Download, Installation, and To build release bits, run \\&quot;make ship\\&quot; or \\&quot;nant -D.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Notes: Zip, UnZip, Download, Installation, and To build release bits, run \\\"make ship\\\" or \\\"nant -D.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/www.centos.org\/docs\/2\/rhl-gsg-en-7.2\/s1-zip-tar.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Zip<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGzip filename.ext.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>UnZip<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGunzip tar.tar.gz.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Download<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTar and Zip both are of same.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Installation<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExtract to %ProgramFiles%.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdd to %Path.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tYou may add a bat file to a directory already in %Path.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>To build release bits, run \"make ship\" or \"nant -D:flavor=ship\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tYou can disable building IA64-specific parts of the custom action library by \"nant -D:ia64=false\".\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/nant\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/nant\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&n